Mechanisms
- crates/bbt-ui/src/modules/settings.rs:106 — serializable host-owned account,
  providers, machines, ordered roles/harnesses, defaults, appearance, shortcuts,
  draft-harness records. No config, keyring, signing or network IO.
- settings.rs:781 — role cards, prompt/default differences, signed-class wording;
  built-in/custom status follows the record. Controls are read-mostly projections.
- settings.rs:950 — harness cards and wake/state/hooks values; custom harnesses
  retain the PTY guard's no-submit/idle-hook wording.
- settings.rs:1095 — retained Box/Text/Flow/ScrollView/Icon/Image/Path composition;
  enclosing width/height only, native metrics determine responsive columns/wrap.
- settings.rs:1588 — full fingerprint and certification path, identity-only
  recovery, local revocation wording, device cards and signatures. Enrollment
  content is centred, with independently checked title/hint/caption geometry.
- settings.rs:2187 — theme/density previews, gutter, opacity and blur/state controls.
  Changed/default comparisons are supplied-record comparisons, never disk reads.
- crates/bboxybook/src/settings.rs:104 — public input to layout; child rects,
  computed CSS, baselines and textBounds are never native placement inputs.
  Per-layout memoization retains actual native font measures, not browser values.
- crates/bboxybook/src/settings.rs:136 — shared external backdrop/ancestor clip,
  followed by native module paint. The in-tab scene's surrounding Sidebar/Strip
  is common context, not claimed as newly built Settings output.
- crates/bboxybook/src/settings.rs:192 — independent rect/baseline snapshots.
- crates/bboxybook/src/modules.rs:1239 — old 150px-nav/info-card placeholder removed;
  the legacy entry delegates to retained Settings.
- crates/bboxybook/capture-inputs.js:160 — captures settingsPage options plus
  public SET/SET_DEF and launch labels; CSS/DOM probes are diagnostic only.
- crates/bboxybook/src/parity.rs:14, :102, :152 — dispatch, snapshots and the
  existing 2% text + 0.5px geometry policy, unchanged thresholds.

